## Tasks

| Command | Action |
|---|---|
| `/release` | Run the full pre-release checklist — version, signing, R8, manifest, logging, tests |
| `/release prepare` | Bump `versionName` / `versionCode`, regenerate `CHANGELOG.md` from Conventional Commits |
| `/release sign` | Generate keystore, wire `signingConfigs`, configure `local.properties` + CI env vars |
| `/release play-store` | Configure Gradle Play Publisher, publish to internal track, promote through alpha/beta/production |
| `/release github` | Build signed AAB + universal APK, create GitHub Release with artifacts and changelog body |

