## Rule 8 — GitHub Release Workflow

Triggered on annotated tag push (`vX.Y.Z`). Builds, signs, uploads AAB to Play internal track, then creates a GitHub Release with the AAB + universal APK attached and the changelog as the body.

```yaml
# .github/workflows/release.yml
name: Release

on:
  push:
    tags:
      - 'v[0-9]+.[0-9]+.[0-9]+'

permissions:
  contents: write        # required to create GitHub Releases

concurrency:
  group: release-${{ github.ref }}
  cancel-in-progress: false   # never cancel an in-flight release

jobs:
  release:
    name: Build · Sign · Publish · Release
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    timeout-minutes: 60
    environment: production   # GitHub Environment with required reviewers

    steps:
      - name: Checkout
        uses: actions/checkout@11bd71901bbe5b1630ceea73d27597364c9af683  # v4.2.2
        with:
          fetch-depth: 0      # full history for changelog generation

      - name: Setup JDK 17
        uses: actions/setup-java@3a4f6e1af504cf6a31855fa899c6aa5355ba6c12  # v4.7.0
        with:
          java-version: 17
          distribution: temurin

      - name: Setup Gradle
        uses: gradle/actions/setup-gradle@0723195856401067f7a2779048b490ace7a47d7c  # v5.0.2
        with:
          cache-encryption-key: ${{ secrets.GRADLE_ENCRYPTION_KEY }}

      - name: Decode keystore
        run: echo "${{ secrets.RELEASE_KEYSTORE_BASE64 }}" | base64 --decode > ${{ runner.temp }}/release.jks

      - name: Decode Play service account
        run: echo "${{ secrets.PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON }}" > ${{ runner.temp }}/play-service-account.json

      - name: Generate changelog
        id: changelog
        run: |
          LAST_TAG=$(git describe --tags --abbrev=0 HEAD^ 2>/dev/null || echo "")
          if [ -z "$LAST_TAG" ]; then
            RANGE="HEAD"
          else
            RANGE="$LAST_TAG..HEAD"
          fi
          {
            echo 'body<<CHANGELOG_EOF'
            echo "## What's Changed"
            echo ""
            echo "### Features"
            git log "$RANGE" --pretty=format:"- %s (%h)" --grep="^feat" || true
            echo ""
            echo "### Fixes"
            git log "$RANGE" --pretty=format:"- %s (%h)" --grep="^fix" || true
            echo ""
            echo "### Other"
            git log "$RANGE" --pretty=format:"- %s (%h)" --invert-grep --grep="^feat" --grep="^fix" --grep="^chore" || true
            echo 'CHANGELOG_EOF'
          } >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"

      - name: Build AAB + universal APK
        env:
          CI_BUILD_NUMBER:                 ${{ github.run_number }}
          RELEASE_STORE_FILE:              ${{ runner.temp }}/release.jks
          RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD:          ${{ secrets.RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD }}
          RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS:               ${{ secrets.RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS }}
          RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD:            ${{ secrets.RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD }}
          PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_PATH:  ${{ runner.temp }}/play-service-account.json
        run: ./gradlew bundleRelease assembleRelease

      - name: Verify R8 ran
        run: |
          test -s app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt \
            || (echo "::error::mapping.txt missing or empty — R8 did not run" && exit 1)

      - name: Publish to Play Store (internal track)
        env:
          PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON_PATH: ${{ runner.temp }}/play-service-account.json
          RELEASE_STORE_FILE:             ${{ runner.temp }}/release.jks
          RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD:         ${{ secrets.RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD }}
          RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS:              ${{ secrets.RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS }}
          RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD:           ${{ secrets.RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD }}
        run: ./gradlew publishReleaseBundle --track internal

      - name: Create GitHub Release
        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@c062e08bd532815e2082a85e87e3ef29c3e6d191  # v2.0.8
        with:
          name: ${{ github.ref_name }}
          body: ${{ steps.changelog.outputs.body }}
          draft: false
          prerelease: false
          files: |
            app/build/outputs/bundle/release/*.aab
            app/build/outputs/apk/release/*-universal-release.apk
            app/build/outputs/mapping/release/mapping.txt

      - name: Shred secrets
        if: always()
        run: |
          shred -u ${{ runner.temp }}/release.jks            || true
          shred -u ${{ runner.temp }}/play-service-account.json || true
```

**Tag and release flow:**
```bash
# 1. Land /release prepare PR (bumps version, regenerates CHANGELOG.md)
# 2. Tag the merge commit on main
git checkout main && git pull
git tag -a v1.4.2 -m "Release v1.4.2"
git push origin v1.4.2

# 3. CI builds, signs, uploads to Play internal, creates GitHub Release
# 4. QA validates on Play internal track
# 5. Promote through alpha → beta → production via Gradle Play Publisher tasks
```

