## Output Format

```
## Release Readiness Report
**App:** com.example.app
**Target version:** 1.4.2 (versionCode 143)
**Date:** 2026-05-26

### Blockers 🔴
- mapping.txt missing — R8 did not run on bundleRelease; isMinifyEnabled is false on :app
- RELEASE_KEYSTORE_BASE64 secret missing in production environment
- versionCode 142 already published to production — must be ≥ 143

### Warnings 🟠
- Timber.DebugTree planted unconditionally in Application.onCreate
- AndroidManifest sets android:debuggable="true" — remove; let Gradle own it
- No mapping.txt upload step in release.yml — symbolication will fail

### Improvements 🟡
- Add staged rollout: userFraction = 0.1 in play{} block
- Add fastlane/metadata changelogs/143.txt for en-US locale
- Pre-release checklist hasn't been run — execute `/release` and confirm all items

### Good ✅
- Play App Signing enrolled
- signingConfig reads from local.properties + env vars
- Gradle Play Publisher configured with track promotion tasks
- CHANGELOG.md regenerated from Conventional Commits
- GitHub release.yml pinned to action SHAs, shreds secrets in always() step
```
